        },
        {
          "step_id": "szr_spo2",
          "text": "Only after the jerking stops. Clip the oximeter on a finger, hand warm, relaxed and still, until it shows one steady number. A normal number does not cancel serious symptoms. The level that needs action: to be set by clinical review. Never delay or stop protecting them and timing the seizure for this.",
